WEBVTT

1
00:00:06,060 --> 00:00:07,020
So what if it looks good

2
00:00:07,220 --> 00:00:08,700
I don't know

3
00:00:09,520 --> 00:00:11,080
Does the other party want to kill me?

4
00:00:15,020 --> 00:00:17,180
Is it possible that I have to die like this?

5
00:00:17,620 --> 00:00:18,660
Death is nothing

6
00:00:19,180 --> 00:00:20,500
Anyway, I already thought about it

7
00:00:20,500 --> 00:00:21,820
After burying Grandpa Li

8
00:00:22,060 --> 00:00:23,860
Put on your wedding clothes and go down to find the young master.

9
00:00:24,640 --> 00:00:25,840
But his head was smashed

10
00:00:25,840 --> 00:00:28,440
Will it be too ugly to die?

11
00:00:28,440 --> 00:00:30,000
Will the young master dislike me?

12
00:00:30,680 --> 00:00:32,840
Does this person want to give me another way to die?

13
00:00:34,700 --> 00:00:36,300
When was I with the young master?

14
00:00:36,700 --> 00:00:38,920
The young master always likes to rub my head like this

15
00:00:40,660 --> 00:00:42,500
Even if he is angry, he still rubs his head

16
00:00:43,110 --> 00:00:48,450
It feels exactly the same as now

17
00:00:48,450 --> 00:01:01,260
This is the voice of the young master

18
00:01:01,260 --> 00:01:03,460
Although the appearance is different

19
00:01:03,820 --> 00:01:05,420
But I remember the voice very clearly
